%description:
Tests a hard ICMPv6 error in SYN_RCVD of a forked connection, as
tcp_icmp_synrcvd_2 for ICMPv4: the tester answers the SYN-ACK of the server with
Destination Unreachable, Port Unreachable (1/4). The forked connection closes,
the listener stays in LISTEN, and the application gets no indication.
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

sim-time-limit = 10s
*.tcptester.script="B1 icmp6 1 4"
*.srv_app.fork=true
*.srv_app.logIndications=true

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[0.001 A001] A.1000 > B.2000: S 0:0(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
srv_tcp: LISTEN --> SYN_RCVD  (on RCV_SYN)
[0.003 B001] A.1000 < B.2000: A S 500:500(0) ack 1 win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize# answering with an ICMP error
srv_tcp: SYN_RCVD --> CLOSED  (on RCV_RST)
[3.001 A002] A.1000 > B.2000: S 0:0(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
srv_tcp: LISTEN --> SYN_RCVD  (on RCV_SYN)
[3.003 B002] A.1000 < B.2000: A S 750500:750500(0) ack 1 win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
cli_tcp: SYN_SENT --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_SYN_ACK)
[3.005 A003] A.1000 > B.2000: A ack 750501 win 16384 
srv_tcp: SYN_RCVD --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_ACK)
srv_app: TCP_I_AVAILABLE
srv_app: TCP_I_ESTABLISHED
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
Hard ICMPv6 error during connection setup -- connection refused
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
